{"id":"501942","name":"虫草花鸡汤","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/501942/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"老母鸡","amount":"半只"},{"name":"虫草花","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白酒","amount":"少许"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好老母鸡和虫草花，清洗干净","img":"images/501942/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鸡肉剁成大块，冷水上锅（加少许白酒）焯水2分钟","img":"images/501942/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"过凉水清洗干净浮沫","img":"images/501942/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"鸡肉块和虫草花加稍宽的水一起放入电高压锅中","img":"images/501942/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"压40分钟（根据鸡的老嫩程度，调整时间），时间结束后，加盐和鸡精调味","img":"images/501942/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"起锅装盘","img":"images/501942/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"好了，美美的来一碗哦😀","img":"images/501942/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"😀","img":"images/501942/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"😀","img":"images/501942/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"😀","img":"images/501942/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电压力锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}